        {
          "text": "Wakayakulula zipaililo zyakuzilundu Hezekiya wisi nzyaakamwayide, alimwi wakayakila Baala zipaililo, akucita zifwanikisyo zyamituni mbubonya mbwaakacita Ahabu mwami wa-Israyeli, akukomba makamu oonse aakujulu akwaamanina milimo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.3",
