        {
          "text": "Acikozyano caAsera ncaakafulidwe wakacibika muŋanda eyo njiyonya Jehova njaakaambila Davida a-Solomoni mwanaakwe kuti, Muŋanda eyi amu-Jerusalemu, ngundakasala kuzwa kumisyobo yoonse ya-Israyeli, monjoobika izina lyangu mane kukabe akutamani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.7",
