        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela nsikooyootuntulisya limbi maulu aabana ba-Israyeli kuzwa munyika eyi njindakapa bamawisi, na baanzika myoyo yabo kukucita zintu zyoonse nzindibalailide amulao woonse Musa mulanda wangu ngwaakabalailila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
