              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaambo bacita bubi mumeso aangu, bandikalazya ciindi coonse kuzwa kubuzuba obuya nindakagwisya bamawisi munyika ya-Egepita akusikila sunu.",
