        {
          "text": "Nkabela Manase wakatila bulowa bwabantu banjibanji ibatakajisi mulandu, mane Jerusalemu wakazula bulowa kuzwa kumagolelo amwi akusikila kumagolelo ambi, Eci cakali atala lyazibi nzyaakacitya ba-Juda mukucita bubi mumeso aa-Jehova.",
          "type": "text",
