        },
        {
          "text": "Lino makani amwi aa-Manase, azyoonse nyizyaakacita, azibi zyakwe nzyaakabisya, sa taalembedwe mubbuku lyamakani aaciindi aabami ba-Juda? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.17",
